@CC ====================================================================
@CC =                                                                  =
@CC = FILE NAME: COS-HENT-E04:MODE                                     =
@CC = LOADING OF COSMOS BASIC MODULE VERSION E                         =
@CC = TO BE RUN DURING COLD-START IN THE FILE HENT-MODE:MODE, ANYWHERE =
@CC = AFTER THE 'INITIALIZE-BACKGROUND-PROGRAMS' COMMAND IS EXECUTED.  =
@CC =                                                                  =
@CC ====================================================================
@CC ***********************
@CC * COSMOS CONNECT-TO : *
@CC ***********************
@OPERATOR *** COSMOS CONNECT-TO IS BEING DUMPED ***
@DELETE-REENTRANT CONNECT-TO
@DUMP-PROGRAM-REENTRANT CONNECT-TO (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-CONN-TO-E:PROG CCT
@DEFINE-REENTRANT-PROGRAM LIST-SYSTEMS 2 3 CCT

@CC ******************
@CC * FILE TRANSFER: *
@CC ******************
@OPERATOR *** COSMOS FILE TRANSFER IS BEING DUMPED ***
@DELETE-REENTRANT TRANSFER-FILE
@DUMP-PROGRAM-REENTRANT TRANSFER-FILE (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-FILE-TRA-E:PROG CFT
@DEFINE-REENTRANT-PROGRAM TRANSFER 2 2 CFT
@DEFINE-REENTRANT-PROGRAM REMOTE-BATCH 3 3 CFT
@DEFINE-REENTRANT-PROGRAM COMPRESS 4 4 CFT
@DEFINE-REENTRANT-PROGRAM COMPRESS-FILE 5 5 CFT
@MODE (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-XFTRA-E:MODE

@CC ********************
@CC * COSMOS SPOOLING: *
@CC ********************
@OPERATOR *** COSMOS SPOOLING IS BEING DUMPED ***
@MODE (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-COSP-VS-E:MODE,,,

@OPERATOR *** COSMOS REMOTE FILE ACCESS IS BEING DUMPED ***
@CC ***************************************
@CC * REMOTE FILE ACCESS, FILE USER PART: *
@CC ***************************************
@MODE (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-FAU-VS-E:MODE,,,

@CC *****************************************
@CC * REMOTE FILE ACCESS, FILE SERVER PART: *
@CC *****************************************
@DELETE-REENTRANT FA-SERVER-TAD
@DELETE-REENTRANT FS-ADMINISTRATOR
@DUMP-PROGRAM-REENTRANT FA-SERVER-TAD (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-FA-SERV-E:PROG
@DUMP-PROGRAM-REENTRANT FS-ADMINISTRATOR (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-FS-ADMIN-E:PROG
@MODE (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-FSART-E:MODE,,,
